OL,3,GNEWSADoctors not 'fixated' on
OL,4,Aweight-loss drug, coroner
OL,5,
OL,6,FDoctors did not fixate on a
OL,7,Fgrandmother's use of Mounjaro
OL,8,Fweight-loss medication before her
OL,9,Fdeath, an inquest heard.
OL,11,FThe family of 73-year-old Caroline
OL,12,FSavage voiced concerns that clinicians
OL,13,Ftoo readily attributed her symptoms to
OL,14,Fside effects of the drug before her
OL,15,Fdeath in 2024.
OL,17,FBut Norfolk area coroner Yvonne Blake
OL,18,Fsaid medics had considered other
OL,19,Fpossibilities too, including
OL,20,Fpancreatitis or an aortic aneurysm.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
