OL,3,GNEWSADoctors not 'fixated' on
OL,4,Aweight-loss drug, coroner
OL,5,
OL,6,FBlake added: "It's not clear to me from
OL,7,Fthe evidence that the doctors were
OL,8,Ffixated with Mounjaro."
